      en: ["Elevation: 3159 meters (10,364 feet).", "Location: Canton of Graubünden, overlooking Lake Sils.", "Range: Bernina Range (Rhaetian Alps).", "First Ascent: June 14, 1857, by J. J. Weilenmann.", "Prominence: 596 meters above the Maloja Pass.", "Recreation: Famous for high-quality summer hiking and winter skiing."],
