      en: ["Elevation: 3945 meters (12,943 feet).", "Location: Border between Switzerland and Italy (Lombardy).", "Range: Bernina Range (Central Eastern Alps).", "First Ascent: 1863 by Seiler and party.", "Etymology: Named after the silver-like appearance of its snow fields.", "Prominence: 100 meters above the Fuorcla dal Zupò."],
